Meanwhile, the plugin template you cloned (or its build.gradle.kts) expects build 242+, meaning 2024.2+, which doesnt exist yet for PhpStorm stable.

 Mismatch between what the plugin expects and what PhpStorm actually is.

 Here's how to fix it:
You must edit your build.gradle.kts and lower the required IntelliJ build to match your real PhpStorm version.

Open build.gradle.kts, find the intellij {} block.
You probably have something like:

