    version.set("231.9225.18")
    type.set("PS") // Important: "PS" = PhpStorm!
}
 Notice:

type.set("PS")  so it knows its PhpStorm, not IntelliJ Community Edition (IC) or Ultimate (IU).

Also, patch plugin compatibility (optional, but good idea):
