Let me explain precisely:

 What the error means:
Could not find com.jetbrains.intellij.phpstorm:phpstorm:251.23774.466

Gradle tried to download PhpStorm artifacts (fake Maven packages for IDEs).

But PhpStorm IDEs are not available in Maven Central  only IntelliJ IDEA (IC, IU) are.

PhpStorm-specific artifacts like PS (PhpStorm) are only provided inside JetBrains special repository, and only for certain versions.

 Why is this happening?
Because in your build.gradle.kts, you have:

kotlin
Copy
Edit
